"<strong>\"A white dwarf is still burning something.\"</strong> There is no fusion; it shines only because its ions are hot.",
"<strong>\"It cools at a steady rate.\"</strong> The hotter it is, the faster it loses heat (L ∝ T_c^{#}), so most of its life is spent faint.",
